json5/key-value-pair
description: Colon-separated pair of a key and a value
- >
  As in JSON — a key and a value separated by a colon; only the key spelling differs, see its
  subchapter below:
- !!<format: text/x-json5> |
  age: 42
- >
  The value can be ANY JSON5 value — the grammar recurses here, which is what lets objects nest
  to any depth:
- *: 00-json5_key
- *..:..:..
